    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Yowashi jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowashi ŵajinjile ucimwene pa ndaŵi jiŵaliji ni yaka msano ni mcece, nipo ŵalamulile ku Yelusalemu yaka yakwana 40. Mamagwe ŵaliji Sibiya wa ku msinda wa Belesheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowashi ŵatesile yakulungama pa ndaŵi jele jwakutaga mbopesi Yehoyada jiŵaliji cijumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada ŵasosele Mwenye Yowashi acakongwe ŵaŵili kuti alombele nipo mwenyewo ŵaŵelece nawo acakongwewo ŵanace ŵacalume ni ŵacakongwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jine jakwe Yowashi ŵaganisisye yakuti alinganye soni Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo jwalakwe ŵalamwile Alefi ni ŵakutaga mbopesi kuti ajawule ku misinda ja ku Yuda kuti akasonjesye mbiya kwa ŵandu ŵa m'misindajo kuti sikamuleje masengo gakulinganyicisya Nyumba ja AMBUJE caka ni caka. Ŵasalile soni jemanjajo kuti ayitende yeleyi mwacitema, nambo Alefi nganatenda yeleyi mwacitema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵamŵilasile Yehoyada juŵaliji mlongola jwawo, ni ŵamwusisye kuti, “Ana ligongo cici nganimwatuma Alefi kuti ajawule kusonjesya mbiya ku Yuda ni ku Yelusalemu syele siŵalamwile Mose",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwakutumicila jwa AMBUJE kuti ŵandu apeleceje mu cipululu mula?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.11+EXO.30.12+EXO.30.13+EXO.30.14+EXO.30.15+EXO.30.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 30:11-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ŵandu ŵaŵamkuyaga Ataliya, jwamkongwe jwakusakala jula, ŵajinjile Nyumba ja AMBUJE, nipo ŵakamulisye masengo yida yiyapelecedwe kwa AMBUJE, pamkulambila nayo Baala.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye ŵalamwile Alefi kuti apanganye libokosi lya matabwa, nipo pitamale kupanganya libokosilyo aliŵice kusa kwa cipata cakwinjilila kwawula ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatumisye utenga kwa ŵandu wosope ŵakutama ku misinda ja Yuda ni Yelusalemu, kuti mundu jwalijose ayiceje ni mbiya syakupeleka kwa AMBUJE, siŵalamwile jwakutumicila Mose kuti apeleceje mu cipululu mula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acimlongola pamo ni ŵandu wosope ŵaliji ŵakusangalala mnope ligongo lya nganisyosi nipo ŵayikaga nasyo mbiya mwakuti syagumbele mwibokosi mula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyuŵa ni lyuŵa Alefi ŵajigalaga libokosi lila nipo ŵajawulaga nalyo kwa nduna sya mwenye, jemanjajo naga ali aweni kuti mwana mbiya syejinji, mlembela jwa mwenye pamo ni jwakwimilila m'malo mwa jwamkulungwa jwa ŵakutaga mbopesi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵatyosyagamo mbiya sila, kaneko ŵajigalaga libokosi lila ni kuliwucisya pa malo gakwe. Ŵatendaga yeleyi lyuŵa ni lyuŵa mwakuti ŵasonjesye mbiya syejinji mwa litala lyeleli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye ni Yehoyada ŵajigalaga mbiyasyo ni kuja kusipeleka kwa acikapitawo ŵakulolela masengo gakulinganya Nyumba ja AMBUJE; ŵalembile soni masengo amisili ŵakutaŵa ni maganga, makalipentala, ni amisili ŵakukamulisya masengo yisyano, kuti jemanjaji alinganye Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu wosope ŵakamwile masengo mwamacili, mwakuti Nyumba ja AMBUJEJO jawonekaga soni cenene mpela mujaŵelele pandanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pigamasile masengo gakulinganya Nyumba ja AMBUJEJO, golidi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni silifa jujwasigelejo ŵampelece kwa mwenye ni kwa Yehoyada, nipo jemanjaji ŵakamulisye golidi ni silifajo masengo gakupanganyicisya mabeseni ni yida yine ya ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu akuleka matala gambone ga Yehoyada",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada piŵaliji cijumi, ŵandu ŵapelekaga mbopesi kaŵilikaŵili ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada ŵacekulwipe mnope, nipo ŵawile piŵaliji ni yaka 130. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵasicile ku malembe ga ayimwene mu msinda wa Daudi, ligongo lyakuti ŵatesile yindu yambone pakwatumicila Aisalaeli, Mlungu, ni m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pandaŵi jiŵawile Yehoyada, acimlongola ŵa ku Yuda ŵayice kukumlambila Mwenye Yowashi, nipo jwalakwe ŵapikanile jemanjajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵalesile kulambila m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE, Mlungu juŵalambilaga acinangolo ŵawo nipo ŵatandite kujitumicila milungu ja cilendo. Myoyo lutumbilo lwa AMBUJE lwaliji pa ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ni ku Yelusalemu ligongo lya ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu ŵatumisye ŵakulocesya kuti ŵakalamusye jemanjajo kuti awujile soni kwa AMBUJE, nambo ŵanduwo ŵakanile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msimu wa Mlungu wamyicilile Sakaliya mwanace jwa Yehoyada jwakutaga mbopesi. Jwalakwe ŵajimi pa malo gakuti ŵandu akombolece kumwona jwalakwejo cenene jwalakwe ŵasalile ŵanduwo kuti, “AMBUJE, Mlungu akuwusya kuti, ana ligongo cici ngamkugapikanila malamusi gawo, nambo mwacimsyene mkulijigalila yisawusyo! Ligongo lyakuti jemanja mwalesile AMBUJE, nombe nawo amlesile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 23:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 11:51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵampanganile Sakaliya nipo mwenye piŵalamwile, ŵandu ŵamsomile jwalakwejo maganga pa luŵala lwa Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Mwenye Yowashi ŵaliŵalile masengo gambone giŵatesile Yehoyada babagwe Sakaliya, m'malo mwakwe ŵamwuleje Sakaliya. Pandaŵi jiŵawaga, jwalakwejo ŵatite, “AMBUJE alole yeleyi, nipo ampe jemanja cilango.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kumala kwa ucimwene wa Yowashi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ndaŵi ja cuku, likuga lya asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Siliya lyayice kuputa ngondo ni asilikali ŵa Mwenye Yowashi. Ŵajile soni kukwatanda ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ni ku Yelusalemu nipo kweleko ŵawuleje acimlongola wosope, ŵajigele soni katundu jwamjinji, jwele juŵamtumisye kwa mwenye jwa ku Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵa ku Siliya ŵaliji ŵapanandi, nambo AMBUJE ŵapundisye jemanjajo ligongo lyakuti ŵandu ŵa kweleko ŵalesile kwapikanila AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakumenyanako Yowashi ŵawulele mnope nipo piŵatyosile asilikali ŵa ku Siliya kwaleka ŵelewo ali awulele mnope, nduna syakwe syampanganile jwalakwejo nipo ŵamwulajile pa cindanda cakwe ligongo lya kuti nombe nawo ŵamwuleje mwanace jwa Yehoyada, nipo ŵasicile mwilembe mu msinda wa Daudi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nambo ngaŵaga m'malembe ga ayimwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵele ŵaŵampanganile Yowashi ŵaliji Sabadi mwanace jwa ŵakongwe ŵane ŵakwe ŵakolanjidwa kuti Shimeyati ŵa ku Amoni, ni Yehosabadi mwanace jwa ŵakongwe ŵane ŵakolanjidwa kuti Shimiliti ŵa ku Mowabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu buku jakulondesya ya ayimwene mwana ngani syakwamba ŵanace ŵa Yowashi, yiŵaŵecete ŵakulocesya yakwamba Yowashi, ni yakutaŵa soni Nyumba ja AMBUJE. Amasiya ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwa babagwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
